{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや誕生日おめでと(*´▽｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nいつも乃木どこでお世話になってますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"設楽さんもお誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は１日\n収録とかレッスンとか\nいろいろだったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\n「16人のプリンシパル duex」\n大阪公演の\n第１次モバイル会員先行申込受付が始まったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\n東京公演の一般販売ももうやってるので\n是非来てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『mina』\nでやってる乃木坂の連載"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は中田が載ってます！\nかずみんもいるよ(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックしてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/04/23/8908715/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかつき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅くなった上、\n後半が\nなんか事務連絡みたいなブログに\nなっちゃったよ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんよ＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もレッスン頑張ります｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}